\section{Coupling to Module A}

Genetic instability increases DNA damage:
\[
D(t)
\leftarrow
D(t)
+
\lambda_A \sum_i g_i(t).
\]

\section{Coupling to Module B}

Pathogen load accelerates senescence:
\[
s(t)
\leftarrow
s(t)
+
\lambda_B P(t).
\]

\section{Coupling to Module C}

Inflammation accelerates telomere attrition:
\[
T(t)
\leftarrow
T(t)
-
\lambda_C \iota(t).
\]

\section{Impact on Global Simulation}

Senescence modifies:
\begin{itemize}
    \item trauma recovery (Module C),
    \item immune exhaustion (Module B),
    \item regulatory collapse (Module A),
    \item global countermeasure effectiveness.
\end{itemize}

Recovery impairment:
\[
\beta_H(t)
=
\beta_H^{(0)}
-
\lambda_{\text{rec}} s(t).
\]

Immune exhaustion:
\[
A(t)
\leftarrow
A(t)
-
\lambda_{\text{exh}} s(t).
\]

\section{Numerical Integration}

Hybrid solver:
\[
\mathbf{z}(t_{k+1})
=
\mathbf{z}(t_k)
+
\Delta t_k\, \Phi_D(\mathbf{z}(t_k), t_k).
\]

